sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Admin/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (admin.leave.index/show)"
    participant Controller as "LeaveRequestController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Klik tombol Hapus
    View->>Controller: DELETE /leaves/{id}
    Controller->>Model: Validasi data pengajuan
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_request by id
    DB-->>Model: Data pengajuan

    alt Data valid (boleh dihapus)
        Controller->>Model: delete(id)
        Model->>DB: DELETE FROM leave_requests WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>Model: Delete success
        Model-->>Controller: true
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi pengajuan berhasil dihapus
    else Data tidak valid (tidak ditemukan/gagal)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal hapus pengajuan
    end
